# Local development configuration
#
# Keyword Explorer / My Apps need no env vars (browser → iTunes).
# Optional ASO Assistant (DeepSeek) requires a server-side key only.

# DeepSeek API key — NEVER put this in client code or commit it.
# Used only by POST /api/chat on the server / Cloudflare Worker.
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Production (Cloudflare):
#   npx wrangler secret put DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
#
# Local:
#   copy this file to .env.local and set DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional founder-owned Apple Ads Platform API v1 (official popularity).
# Visitors never see these. Used only by POST /api/popularity.
# APPLE_ADS_CLIENT_ID=
# APPLE_ADS_TEAM_ID=
# APPLE_ADS_KEY_ID=
# APPLE_ADS_PRIVATE_KEY=
# APPLE_ADS_ACCOUNT_ID=
#
# Production:
#   npx wrangler secret put APPLE_ADS_CLIENT_ID
#   npx wrangler secret put APPLE_ADS_TEAM_ID
#   npx wrangler secret put APPLE_ADS_KEY_ID
#   npx wrangler secret put APPLE_ADS_PRIVATE_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put APPLE_ADS_ACCOUNT_ID

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Monetization (ADR 0004): accounts, Paddle billing, cloud sync.
# Everything below is optional; without it the routes degrade to 503 and the
# account/upgrade UI stays hidden (NEXT_PUBLIC_PRO_ENABLED=0).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Rollout switches:
# - PRO_ENABLED=1 (server): apply plan quotas and account keying in
#   /api/popularity + /api/chat. Worker secret or local .env.local.
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_PRO_ENABLED=1 (build-time): show account/upgrade UI and
#   enforce plan limits in the browser. Set as a GitHub Actions variable
#   (see README "Monetization setup").
# PRO_ENABLED=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRO_ENABLED=

# Paddle (merchant of record). API key and webhook secret are server-only:
# PADDLE_API_KEY=
# PADDLE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# PADDLE_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox            # sandbox | production
# PADDLE_PRO_PRICE_IDS=pri_monthly,pri_yearly   # comma-separated allowlist
#
# Public build-time vars (safe for the browser):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PADDLE_CLIENT_TOKEN=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PADDLE_ENV=sandbox
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PADDLE_PRICE_PRO_MONTHLY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PADDLE_PRICE_PRO_YEARLY=

# Resend — email magic links (server-only):
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# RESEND_FROM=AppClimb <no-reply@appclimb.app>

# Google OAuth sign-in (server-only):
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
#
# Authorized redirect URI: https://appclimb.app/api/auth/google/callback

# Production:
#   npx wrangler secret put PADDLE_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put PADDLE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#   npx wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
#   npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
#   npx wrangler secret put PRO_ENABLED   # value: 1
